{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/azizi-samia-jebel-ali","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":425,"crm_id":"1720","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"ready","title":"Azizi Samia","slug":"azizi-samia-jebel-ali","display_address":"Jebel Ali","building_type":["apartment","studio"],"completion_year":"Ready","developer":"Azizi Developments","price":2150000,"display_price":"2.15M","lattitude":25.0262923,"longitude":55.1362412,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":2,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Azizi Samia is a 15-story building in Al Furjan neighborhood by Azizi Developments. The project offers <strong>studios and apartments with 1-2 bedrooms</strong>. All units are fully furnished with turnkey finishes and appliances.</p><p>The infrastructure of the complex includes swimming pools for adults and children, sunbathing and recreation area, fully equipped modern gym, spa center with sauna and steam room, which are available to all who live in the complex, stores restaurants and cafes, parking, 24-hour concierge service, security and much more.</p><p>Azizi Samia Residence is located in Dubai, in the Al Furjan area, just off Sheikh Zayed Road. This is the main and longest street of the city. It passes through all the key points of the emirate and connects Dubai with Abu Dhabi. It takes 25 minutes to reach the world's tallest tower Burj Khalifa by car, 16 minutes to get to the picturesque Dubai Marina, and 30 minutes to the airport. Al Furjan Metro Station is 2.8 km away. The famous Madame Tussauds Dubai Amusement Park is a 14-minute drive away. The Arbor School is a 7-minute walk away. Kids Kare Nursery JLT is a 13-minute drive away, and Spinneys grocery store is a 5-minute drive away. Near the complex there are many sporting activities: Arbor School Badminton Court, Jumeirah Golf Estates golf course, Dubai Polo &amp; Equestrian Club.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1720/images/2024/04/24/lWBOq1IQjtrCSVQfvOVWywT6PdeLuSkA3hGOrG3B.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/04/24/lWBOq1IQjtrCSVQfvOVWywT6PdeLuSkA3hGOrG3B.png","__ggfxIndex":0},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1720/images/2024/04/24/rbhdRExPJltZKRA88Qq8yZ8KPwZf2GZ4bdPxN2Lh.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/04/24/rbhdRExPJltZKRA88Qq8yZ8KPwZf2GZ4bdPxN2Lh.png","__ggfxIndex":1},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1720/images/2024/04/24/B0wsXJxERDnegieQOZVk4CM1Od8Xg2h0wu1MuDcM.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/04/24/B0wsXJxERDnegieQOZVk4CM1Od8Xg2h0wu1MuDcM.png","__ggfxIndex":2}],"characteristics_module":null,"location_tile":null,"brochure":{"id":2101,"url":"","file":null,"item":[],"image":null},"video_module":{"id":1348,"thumbnail":null,"video_url":null},"floor_plans":[],"payment_plan_text":"20/80","payment_plans":[{"id":6699,"title":"20%","description":"On Booking"},{"id":6700,"title":"80%","description":"On Handover"}],"community":"Jebel Ali","publish":1,"currency":"AED","amenities":[{"id":11638,"url":null,"text":"Covered Parking","type":null,"image":null},{"id":11639,"url":null,"text":"Security and CCTV","type":null,"image":null},{"id":11640,"url":null,"text":"Concierge Service","type":null,"image":null},{"id":11641,"url":null,"text":"Children’s pool","type":null,"image":null},{"id":11642,"url":null,"text":"Shared Pool","type":null,"image":null},{"id":11643,"url":null,"text":"Shared SPA","type":null,"image":null},{"id":11644,"url":null,"text":"Kids Play Area","type":null,"image":null},{"id":11645,"url":null,"text":"Lobby","type":null,"image":null},{"id":11646,"url":null,"text":"Shared gym & fitness","type":null,"image":null},{"id":11647,"url":null,"text":"Leisure areas","type":null,"image":null},{"id":11648,"url":nul